    let help_text = "A modern alternative to the watch command, records the differences in execution results and can check this differences at after.

Usage: executable [OPTIONS] [command]...

Arguments:
  [command]...  

Options:
  -b, --batch                         output execution results to stdout
  -B, --beep                          beep if command has a change result
      --border                        Surround each pane with a border frame
